# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows but linted by ruff and prettier, both of
# which normalise to LF. Without this file every checkout rewrites to CRLF and
# every formatter run shows the whole file as changed.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.db   binary
*.sqlite3 binary
